From 61d1efea6b30699f62ad8d1a0fc85881e2ad8b4c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nags <nags@kalaa-bhadra.local>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 14:21:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] security: zod validation everywhere + studio/admin hardening
 + data integrity (P7/P8/P9)

P7 - validation at every server-action boundary (zod):
- New src/lib/validation.ts: shared schemas (cuid, email, Indian phone/PIN,
  https URLs, ratings, quantities, money) + composite inputs for checkout,
  messages, reviews, commissions, search, artwork forms.
- checkout/messages/reviews/commissions/follows/wishlist/notifications/
  search/studio/admin all safeParse inputs before touching the DB.
- Prisma/internal errors now log server-side and return generic client
  messages (toClientError); no more error.message passthrough.

P8 - hardening:
- updateArtworkAction: status stripped from payload (no creator self-publish).
- updateStudioOrderStatusAction: creator-ownership check + forward-only
  state-transition map; buyer gets a real status-change email (shipment,
  out-for-delivery, delivered).
- createNotificationAction removed from the exported server-action surface
  (now internal src/lib/notify.ts); mark-read enforces ownership.
- getCurrentAdmin: dev backdoor deleted; explicit seeded admin is the path.
- JSON-LD '<' escaped (stored XSS); next/image remotePatterns locked to
  Cloudinary/Unsplash/Pexels/Cashfree; CSP header added (Cashfree SDK
  allow-listed).
- Image URLs allow-listed to the upload pipeline (Cloudinary), Unsplash,
  Pexels, or the app domain.
- Shared rate limiter (src/lib/rate-limit.ts); applied to upload, messages,
  reviews, commissions, search.
- sendEmail: Resend failures and unconfigured provider in production now
  return success:false; added payout-settled email.
- Order page no longer shows 'Order Confirmed' for unpaid orders.
- next 16.3.5 -> 16.3.8, eslint-config-next to match.

P9 - data integrity:
- 18/20 seed artwork photos replaced with visually-verified correct images
  (17 Pexels, 1 Unsplash); fix-artwork-images.ts rewritten as an idempotent
  repair script for existing DBs; one mislabeled detail photo removed.
- seed.ts refuses to run its destructive wipe against production without
  ALLOW_DESTRUCTIVE_SEED=true.
- Dead models removed: StockReservation (+ReservationStatus), Coupon
  (+Order.couponId).
- Composite indexes for the explore query; CHECK constraints as idempotent
  SQL in prisma/p9-check-constraints.sql (db-push project, no migrations).
